-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
3. HOW A LICENCE STAYS ACTIVE
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

A licence is renewed automatically by our licence server while the application
runs. A computer that cannot reach the internet continues to work for five days
and then pauses until it connects once. This does not shorten the subscription
you bought: the expiry date you were issued is unchanged.

Where these terms are breached - in particular by sharing keys or tampering
with the licensing mechanism - we may stop renewing the licence concerned,
which ends it on that computer within five days. We will say why.

